      "writtenOn": "2022-09-12T21:03:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this fix was exactly how I\u0027d initially thought it should be, but my big comment has me actually wondering if we need the SsboTracker\u0027s alignment logic when writing uniforms to handle this extra padding.",
      "revId": "9409546712a04e2e2963ced407519f92a9850c6a",
