      "writtenOn": "2022-09-13T13:37:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, what you\u0027re proposing is what I originally planned. However, I\u0027m not clear what you mean by \u0027this\u0027 in \u0027I think we should stick with this\u0027. And by elements do you mean data blocks or individual uniforms?",
      "parentUuid": "204a5381_737933fa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 224,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 224,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "9409546712a04e2e2963ced407519f92a9850c6a",
